From 891ae53b3c3ef4091aa778fcb280441079f7978b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:35:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 182/258] feat(tools): add C8 L4 W8A8 gold-vs-ours comparison
 tool (Q3); archive Q5's same-named variant as c8_l4_compare_ours_dir.py

Cherry-picked from c8-l4-avx512 (4d3a42ca5); the original commit also created
tools/c8_l4_compare.py, which collided with the identically named tool from
c8-l4-sve256 already merged. Q3's version is kept as the canonical judge
(it produced the main prefill verdict and the decode extension); Q5's
ours-dir variant is archived next to it so the SVE256 rerun can converge on
one judge and the two legs stay comparable.
---
